{"id":4402,"date":"2024-09-04T17:05:14","date_gmt":"2024-09-04T15:05:14","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/venol.de\/?page_id=4402"},"modified":"2024-09-04T17:08:22","modified_gmt":"2024-09-04T15:08:22","slug":"laboratoire","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/venol.de\/fr\/entreprise\/laboratoire\/","title":{"rendered":"Laboratoire"},"content":{"rendered":"<div id='layer_slider_1'  class='avia-layerslider main_color avia-shadow  avia-builder-el-0  el_before_av_layerslider  avia-builder-el-first  container_wrap fullsize'  style='height: 651px; max-width: 1410px; margin: 0 auto;'  ><\/div>\n<div id='layer_slider_2'  class='avia-layerslider main_color avia-shadow  avia-builder-el-1  el_after_av_layerslider  el_before_av_textblock  slider-not-first container_wrap fullsize'  style='height: 501px; max-width: 425px; margin: 0 auto;'  ><\/div><div id='after_layer_slider_2'  class='main_color av_default_container_wrap container_wrap fullsize'  ><div class='container av-section-cont-open' ><div class='template-page content  av-content-full alpha units'><div class='post-entry post-entry-type-page post-entry-4402'><div class='entry-content-wrapper clearfix'>\n<section  class='av_textblock_section av-lyevn4ey-95dba3fc88288e36bd88a1d8fb540a52 '   itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https:\/\/schema.org\/CreativeWork\" ><div class='avia_textblock'  itemprop=\"text\" ><p>Le laboratoire de recherche et d\u00e9veloppement de VENOL MOTOR OIL est une constitu\u00e9 d\u2019une \u00e9quipe jeune, cr\u00e9ative et dynamique. Nos employ\u00e9s sont des sp\u00e9cialistes qualifi\u00e9s et exp\u00e9riment\u00e9s qui am\u00e9liorent constamment leurs connaissances. Leurs comp\u00e9tences, leur fiabilit\u00e9 et leur pr\u00e9cision leur permettent d\u2019exploiter pleinement le potentiel des installations technologiques de notre laboratoire. En outre, nous disposons d\u2019un \u00e9quipement de mesure de pointe qui nous permet d\u2019effectuer des tests tels que :<\/p>\n<\/div><\/section>\n\n<style type=\"text\/css\" data-created_by=\"avia_inline_auto\" id=\"style-css-av-lyew7ngu-e5790f48b07e299f730e5ce5e964ae18\">\n#top .flex_column.av-lyew7ngu-e5790f48b07e299f730e5ce5e964ae18{\nmargin-top:0px;\nmargin-bottom:0px;\n}\n.responsive #top #wrap_all .flex_column.av-lyew7ngu-e5790f48b07e299f730e5ce5e964ae18{\nmargin-top:0px;\nmargin-bottom:0px;\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='flex_column av-lyew7ngu-e5790f48b07e299f730e5ce5e964ae18 av_one_third  avia-builder-el-3  el_after_av_textblock  el_before_av_one_third  first flex_column_div  column-top-margin'     ><section  class='av_textblock_section av-lyevoe6q-c4a843a3cf637bde89730a96eb27cf2d '   itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https:\/\/schema.org\/CreativeWork\" ><div class='avia_textblock'  itemprop=\"text\" ><ul>\n<li>Viscosit\u00e9 cin\u00e9matique,<\/li>\n<li>Indice de viscosit\u00e9 (IV),<\/li>\n<li>Viscosit\u00e9 structurelle (VS),<\/li>\n<li>Temp\u00e9rature de d\u00e9part,<\/li>\n<li>Point d\u2019\u00e9clair,<\/li>\n<li>Temp\u00e9rature de cristallisation,<\/li>\n<li>Point d\u2019\u00e9bullition,<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div><\/section><\/div>\n\n<style type=\"text\/css\" data-created_by=\"avia_inline_auto\" id=\"style-css-av-lyew9slb-dd86540535b473f0902c2c05be38b0a4\">\n#top .flex_column.av-lyew9slb-dd86540535b473f0902c2c05be38b0a4{\nmargin-top:0px;\nmargin-bottom:0px;\n}\n.flex_column.av-lyew9slb-dd86540535b473f0902c2c05be38b0a4{\npadding:0 0 0 0;\n}\n.responsive #top #wrap_all .flex_column.av-lyew9slb-dd86540535b473f0902c2c05be38b0a4{\nmargin-top:0px;\nmargin-bottom:0px;\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='flex_column av-lyew9slb-dd86540535b473f0902c2c05be38b0a4 av_one_third  avia-builder-el-5  el_after_av_one_third  el_before_av_one_third  flex_column_div av-zero-column-padding  column-top-margin'     ><section  class='av_textblock_section av-lyevp0he-f7696914e3410086ea0950efe41d1dd6 '   itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https:\/\/schema.org\/CreativeWork\" ><div class='avia_textblock'  itemprop=\"text\" 