content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/laboratorium-04-hover.jpg 750w, https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/laboratorium-04-hover-225x300.jpg 225w, https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/laboratorium-04-hover-529x705.jpg 529w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" \/><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div>\n<div  class='flex_column av-4e1dch-287a3cc524a9f815ed1e5e37cfd23c86 av_one_half  avia-builder-el-17  el_after_av_one_fourth  el_before_av_one_half  first flex_column_div  column-top-margin'     ><section  class='av_textblock_section av-lyevs24g-0203bf0f8c2686751dc9ab8fce603a47 '   itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https:\/\/schema.org\/CreativeWork\" ><div class='avia_textblock'  itemprop=\"text\" ><p>Le laboratoire supervise l\u2019ensemble du processus de production, depuis le contr\u00f4le des mati\u00e8res premi\u00e8res jusqu\u2019au contr\u00f4le de la qualit\u00e9 des produits finis, en passant par le contr\u00f4le du processus de m\u00e9lange et de confiserie.<\/p>\n<p>Nous veillons \u00e0 ce que nos produits r\u00e9pondent aux normes de qualit\u00e9 les plus \u00e9lev\u00e9es.<\/p>\n<\/div><\/section><\/div>\n<div  class='flex_column av-2xjkxt-99502687ebe3373987084a16c7c4d6d7 av_one_half  avia-builder-el-19  el_after_av_one_half  avia-builder-el-last  flex_column_div  column-top-margin'     ><section  class='av_textblock_section av-lyevsdhq-dd8070c6436a99fcca8041590d238623 '   itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https:\/\/schema.org\/CreativeWork\" ><div class='avia_textblock'  itemprop=\"text\" ><p>Les travaux de recherche et de d\u00e9veloppement jouent un r\u00f4le important dans le travail quotidien du laboratoire. Nous recherchons de nouvelles solutions technologiques pour am\u00e9liorer les produits de nos marques.<\/p>\n<p>Nous nous attachons \u00e0 d\u00e9velopper en permanence les comp\u00e9tences de nos employ\u00e9s et \u00e0 moderniser nos installations de recherche pour r\u00e9pondre aux exigences \u00e9lev\u00e9es de nos clients.<\/p>\n<\/div><\/section><\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"","protected":false},"author":5,"featured_media":0,"parent":4374,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-4402","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/4402","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/page"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/5"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=4402"}],"version-history":[{"count":3,"href":"https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/4402\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":4406,"href":"https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/4402\/revisions\/4406"}],"up":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/4374"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=4402"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}